A patch on upstream Mermaid at the pin, for the reference ferrigura is checked against
(docs-port/ORACLE-PLAN.md). Applied in the order of the file names by tools/reference/setup.sh.

fix(config): drop the stray c4.flowchart default section

defaultConfig.ts spread the flowchart defaults into a `flowchart` block
nested in the c4 section, to default `inheritDir` to false. Nothing
reads `c4.flowchart`; the flowchart section already gets `inheritDir:
false` from the schema, so the block only added a misplaced copy of the
flowchart config under c4.

The fork's commit c2057b2d2, its changes to packages/ and .build/.

